SC-Embedding

This release extracts the selective contextual embedding method from the
SelectiveMemoryEmbedding research codebase. The source code is distributed
under the repository's Apache License 2.0.

The training setup builds on EvoEmbedding and the EvoTrain-180K dataset
(MiG-NJU/EvoTrain-180K). Backbone weights are provided separately by Qwen.
Transformers, PEFT, PyTorch, and their dependencies retain their own licenses.
The release does not redistribute third-party base-model weights or datasets.
